name: sim.getDoubleSignal
description: 
luaSynopsis: float signalValue=sim.getFloatSignal(string signalName)
pythonSynopsis: float signalValue=sim.getFloatSignal(string signalName)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. signalName: name of the signal
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. signalValue: value of the signal. nil if operation was not successful or if signal does not exist
